{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Mezmur Zelideta API","version":"1.0.0","description":"REST API for the Mezmur Zelideta (መዝሙር ዘልደታ).\n\n**Envelope.** Every response is `{ success, code, message, data, errors[], meta? }`.\n`code` is a stable machine code (e.g. `DEVICE_ALREADY_REGISTERED`); the mobile app maps it to Amharic text.\n`errors[]` items are `{ field, code, message }` (validation codes such as `REQUIRED`, `INVALID_PHONE`, `PASSWORD_WEAK`).\n`meta` carries pagination `{ page, limit, total, pages }` on list endpoints (`?page=&limit=`, limit ≤ 100).\n\n**Auth.** `Authorization: Bearer <access token>` (JWT, HS256, 15 min). Refresh with the opaque refresh token\n(rotated on every use; reuse revokes the whole session family).\n\n**Permissions.** Admin endpoints list the required permission as `x-permission`. Permissions are enforced by\nthe backend on every request — hiding UI is cosmetic only. Denied attempts are written to the audit log.\n\n**Status codes.** 200/201 success · 400 malformed · 401 unauthenticated (`TOKEN_EXPIRED`, `SESSION_REVOKED`,\n`INVALID_TOKEN`) · 403 forbidden (`FORBIDDEN`, `ACCOUNT_DISABLED`, `PASSWORD_CHANGE_REQUIRED`) · 404 · 409 conflict\n· 413 file too large · 422 validation · 429 rate limited / `ACCOUNT_LOCKED` · 500 `SERVER_ERROR` (no internals).\n\n\n**Outside /api/v1:** `GET /download` (public download page) · `GET /download/android/{code|latest}.apk`."},"servers":[{"url":"/api/v1"}],"tags":[{"name":"Auth"},{"name":"Me"},{"name":"Content"},{"name":"Library"},{"name":"Programs"},{"name":"Notifications"},{"name":"Promotions"},{"name":"Borrowing"},{"name":"Admin — Users"},{"name":"Admin — Administrators"},{"name":"Admin — Supervision"},{"name":"Sync"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearer":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT"}},"parameters":{"id":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"page":{"name":"page","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"limit":{"